From 6ccc834360eaddcea793ebdca09b767828b65e51 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Q-Sunshine Transport <transport@q-sunshine.invalid>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 17:02:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] transport: reduce Sunshine to the PVE QEMU console media
 plane

Build a fixed QEMU Console GameStream media service for the Proxmox transport. The PVE integration owns authorization, selection, session lifetime, and host-side process orchestration; this profile retains only the mTLS HTTPS/RTSP media plane and required QEMU guest bridges.

The transport profile has one fixed console entry, rejects application manifests and preparation commands, forces the QEMU-only capture graph, and excludes legacy pairing, UI, discovery, UPnP, display, host execution, and plaintext HTTP bootstrap handling.
